<title>USA: Texas/w Okla cattle trade slow, few $64 sales-USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla cattle trade slow, few $64 sales-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade slow in the panhandle area early Friday.</p>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers steady.</p>
<p>Feedlots reporting limited inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>Sales reported on 900 slaughter steers and 200 heifers following the weekly movement of 137,300 head.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1250 lbs 64.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1150 lbs 64.00.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
